        <item>
            <title>1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:21:03 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>211</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Lunchbox 1.2</h2>
<p>New windows fill your screen more calmly: a third goes beneath the second and a fourth beneath the first, so nothing jumps across the screen, and on a MacBook two windows sit side by side. In Focus, the Shelf's windows light up when you point at them, and setup now teaches closing a window and Resize mode.</p>
]]></description>
